# Use resources/.env for BLNK_API_KEY and BLNK_BASE_URL (see README).
#
# RECURRING_WAIT_FOR_APPLY (optional)
# - Leave unset or set to anything other than "true": script exits after creating
#   the scheduled charge. The charge still runs ~4 minutes later; check balance later.
# - Set to "true": script waits ~4 minutes for the charge to apply, then prints
#   Marcus's balance again so you see the $10 deduction in the same run.
# RECURRING_WAIT_FOR_APPLY=true
